Returns a C<WorkspaceInstance>.

The required values are:

=over

=item C<$friendly_name>

A descriptive string that you create to describe the Workspace resource. It can
be up to 64 characters long. For example: C<Customer Support> or C<2014
Election Campaign>.

=back

The options are:

=over

=item C<event_callback_url>

The URL we should call when an event occurs. If provided, the Workspace will
publish events to this URL, for example, to collect data for reporting. See
L<Workspace Events|https://www.twilio.com/docs/taskrouter/api/event> for more
